## Serverless 架构模式

### Web API

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Client[客户端] --> APIGW[API Gateway]
    APIGW --> Lambda1[GET /users Lambda]
    APIGW --> Lambda2[POST /users Lambda]
    APIGW --> Lambda3[GET /orders Lambda]
    Lambda1 --> DDB[(DynamoDB)]
    Lambda2 --> DDB
    Lambda3 --> DDB
```

### 异步处理管道

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Upload[S3 文件上传] --> Lambda1[图片处理 Lambda]
    Lambda1 --> Lambda2[缩略图生成 Lambda]
    Lambda2 --> S3[(S3 存储)]
    Lambda1 --> SQS[SQS 队列]
    SQS --> Lambda3[元数据提取 Lambda]
    Lambda3 --> DDB[(DynamoDB)]
```

